                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "e6dc75be-a70e-3b4c-9727-fc8ac1232f2f",
                        "entry_id": "73d13f2a-8526-37fb-9f1d-9a9ee2b45682",
                        "glosses": [
                            "To intrude; To force or thrust into"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "259479e4-13d9-4afa-8947-049d42c05b6b",
                                "sense_id": "e6dc75be-a70e-3b4c-9727-fc8ac1232f2f",
                                "text": "Then seek, amongst the multitude Of lovers that dare to intertrude Into your favours, One that may Love for an age, and not a day;"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "76840c2c-643a-4e97-86bc-5eab96c158aa",
                                "sense_id": "e6dc75be-a70e-3b4c-9727-fc8ac1232f2f",
                                "text": "Other rocks intertrude irregularly in the form of beds and veins, as serpentine, soapstone, rensselaerite, granite and primitive limestone."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "69b3ece7-55b7-48a9-bef4-072887087cf5",
                                "sense_id": "e6dc75be-a70e-3b4c-9727-fc8ac1232f2f",
                                "text": "And, contradiction, like a discord breaking on the ear, Wilt intertrude its hateful presence, hoot, deny and jeer."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "6e911913-f00c-44c3-a6be-04cd5366e980",
                                "sense_id": "e6dc75be-a70e-3b4c-9727-fc8ac1232f2f",
                                "text": "Snatches of other voices seemed often to intertrude themselves in the parley; and your loyal effort not to overhear these was complicated by your fear of missing what Eva might be twittering."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
